It's a great game as it is, but here are some suggestions that would make the game even better:
- New levels (with more music, maybe haha);
- Customization options (player colors, for example);
- Steam Workshop integration;
- A level editor;
- A matchmaking system for playing with random people, instead of only against friends.
These are things that would make the game more diverse, and thus it would be more enjoyable for people to play it for more time. I recommend it, but it seems like it will get boring as time goes by, specially when you want to play it, but you don't have many friends to play with.

